# Feishu

Call the Feishu Open API as the connected user via the bundled helper.
**You are already authenticated** — the egress proxy injects the user's
Feishu token on the wire. Never ask for or handle tokens.

{{ACTION_AVAILABILITY_SECTION}}

## Usage

    python .opencode/skills/feishu/feishu_api.py <command> [args]

Output is JSON on stdout. A business failure prints
`{"ok": false, "code": ..., "msg": "..."}` — surface the `msg` to the user.
Every endpoint not covered below is reachable through `raw`:

```
python feishu_api.py raw GET /wiki/v2/spaces/7419.../nodes --param page_size=50
python feishu_api.py raw POST /im/v1/messages --data '{"receive_id":"oc_x","msg_type":"text","content":"{\"text\":\"hi\"}"}'
```

IDs are tenant-specific — always list/search first, then use the returned ids.
Message sends default to ASK for approval; expect an HTTP 403 with guidance
while approval is pending, and tell the user to approve it in Onyx.

### Chats & messages

```
feishu_api.py chats
feishu_api.py history oc_1234 [--start 1730000000] [--end 1730003600]
feishu_api.py read om_5678
feishu_api.py send oc_1234 --text "Deploy finished"          # to a chat (chat_id)
feishu_api.py send ou_5678 --receive-id-type open_id --text "hi"
feishu_api.py send oc_1234 --msg-type interactive --content '{"config":...}'
feishu_api.py reply om_5678 --text "on it"
feishu_api.py search-messages "quarterly report"
```

### Documents & wiki

```
feishu_api.py search-docs "OKR 规划"
feishu_api.py doc DOCNODE123        # plain text (docx raw content)
feishu_api.py doc-blocks DOCNODE123 # structured blocks
feishu_api.py doc-create "Weekly Notes" [--folder-token fld...]
feishu_api.py wiki-spaces
feishu_api.py wiki-nodes 741956...
```

A wiki node's `obj_token` is the document id for `doc` / `doc-blocks`.

### Drive, sheets, bitable

```
feishu_api.py drive-files [--folder-token fld...]
feishu_api.py download CNabC... -o ./report.xlsx
feishu_api.py sheet-values CNabC... "sheetId!A1:D10"
feishu_api.py sheet-write CNabC... "sheetId!A1:B2" '[["k","v"],["a",1]]'
feishu_api.py bitable-tables CNabC...
feishu_api.py bitable-records CNabC... tbl123
feishu_api.py bitable-search CNabC... tbl123 --body '{"filter":{...}}'
feishu_api.py bitable-create-record CNabC... tbl123 '{"标题":"x","状态":"todo"}'
```

### Tasks & calendar

```
feishu_api.py tasklists
feishu_api.py tasks <tasklist_guid>
feishu_api.py task-create "Review PR #12" --due 2026-10-09T18:00:00+08:00
feishu_api.py task-complete <task_guid>
feishu_api.py calendars
feishu_api.py events cal_123 --start 2026-10-05T00:00:00+08:00 --end 2026-10-06T00:00:00+08:00
feishu_api.py event-create cal_123 "Design review" --start ... --end ... --attendee ou_...
```

### Contacts & people

```
feishu_api.py user ou_5678
feishu_api.py dept-users 0
feishu_api.py resolve-users someone@example.com   # email -> open_id
```

To DM a colleague, resolve their email to an `open_id` first, then
`send ou_... --receive-id-type open_id`.
